</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.5.21" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="alg1.5.21.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">  </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="alg1.5.21.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">    </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="alg1.5.21.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">  </span>
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.5.21.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">20</span></span>
              <span id="alg1.5.21.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Optimization Process by Eq. </span><a href="#S2.E3" title="In RLVR Paradigm ‣ II-C Curriculum-based Verifiable Rewarded Training (CVRT) ‣ II Proposed Framework ‣ Vul-R2: A Reasoning LLM for Automated Vulnerability Repair" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:80%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a><span id="alg1.5.21.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">, 5, 6, and 7 with </span><math id="alg1.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{\text{hard}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">x</mi><mtext mathsize="0.800em">hard</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{\text{hard}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.5.21.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">, </span><math id="alg1.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i_{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">i</mi><mi mathsize="0.800em">n</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i_{n}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.5.21.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">, </span><math id="alg1.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.800em">y</mi><mi mathsize="0.800em">n</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{n}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.5.21.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.5.22" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="alg1.5.22.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">  </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="alg1.5.22.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">    </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="alg1.5.22.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">  </span>
